### KAFKA DEMONSTRATION
### ==========================================

### 9. Register Customer - CustomerRegistered Event
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Kafka Demo Customer",
  "email": "kafka.demo@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "0187654321",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "dateOfBirth": "2005-06-10"
}